<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.25;color:#0a0a0a;">
  Complete your payment
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5ba60b;">
  Awaiting payment
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  We reserved your items for order <strong>#{{order_number}}</strong>. Please complete payment soon so we can start processing it.
</p>

{{#> details}}
  {{> detail-row label="Order number" value=order_number}}
  {{> detail-row label="Status" value="Awaiting payment"}}
{{/details}}

{{#> tip title="Reserved briefly"}}
  Inventory is held for a limited time. If payment is not completed before the reservation expires, the order will be cancelled and stock returned.
{{/tip}}

<p style="margin:0;">
  If you already paid, you can ignore this email. Reply if you need help finishing checkout.
</p>
